        "original_id": "b755975f-3db3-5a52-8ac9-1f4500011797",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Battle of Cambrai (1918), Hundred Days Offensive, Battle of Amiens, First World War\n- Organizations: British First Army, British Third Army, British Fourth Army, German Empire forces, Allies, Central Powers\n- Places: Western Front\n\nFacts:\n- The Hundred Days Offensive was the final period of the First World War on the Western Front from 8 August to 11 November 1918.\n- The Hundred Days Offensive began with the Battle of Amiens.\n- During the Hundred Days Offensive, the Allies launched a series of offensives against the Central Powers.\n- The Battle of Cambrai (1918), also known as the Second Battle of Cambrai, was fought during the Hundred Days Offensive of the First World War.\n- The Battle of Cambrai (1918) was a battle between the British First, Third, and Fourth Armies and German Empire forces.",
